#. module: aypatech_ai_assistant
#: model:aypatech_ai.agent.suggestion,prompt:aypatech_ai_assistant.ai_agent_read_only_suggestion_revenue
msgid ""
"Report invoiced revenue for the last 6 full calendar months (exclude the current partial month).\n"
"\n"
"Scope: posted customer invoices (`account.move`, type `out_invoice`, state `posted`), minus credit notes (`out_refund`).\n"
"\n"
"Per month table:\n"
"- Month (YYYY-MM)\n"
"- Total invoiced (untaxed and tax-included)\n"
"- Number of invoices\n"
"- Top 3 customers contributing and their share\n"
"- Month-over-month % change on the tax-excluded total\n"
"\n"
"End with:\n"
"- 6-month total (untaxed and tax-included)\n"
"- Average monthly revenue\n"
"- Use the default company currency; do not convert."
msgstr ""
"Rapportez le chiffre d'affaires facturé des 6 derniers mois civils complets (excluez le mois partiel en cours).\n"
"\n"
"Périmètre : factures clients comptabilisées (`account.move`, type `out_invoice`, état `posted`), moins les avoirs (`out_refund`).\n"
"\n"
"Tableau par mois :\n"
"- Mois (YYYY-MM)\n"
"- Total facturé (hors taxes et toutes taxes comprises)\n"
"- Nombre de factures\n"
"- Top 3 des clients contributeurs et leur part\n"
"- Variation en % mois sur mois du total hors taxes\n"
"\n"
"Terminez par :\n"
"- Total sur 6 mois (hors taxes et toutes taxes comprises)\n"
"- Chiffre d'affaires mensuel moyen\n"
"- Utilisez la devise par défaut de la société ; ne convertissez pas."

